{"song_id": 395633, "title": "Le Fl\u00e9au", "language": "fr", "lyricists": [55334], "lyrics": [{"section_id": "section_0", "type": "intro", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Bandes de p'tites *bip*", "rhyme": "ip", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "C'est King Ju au microphone", "rhyme": "On", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Eh ouais, hahaha !", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Et toi petite tu veux savoir o\u00f9 c'est le prochain concert de Stupeflip ?!", "rhyme": "ip", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "C'est la semaine prochaine et c'est dans ton cul", "rhyme": "y", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABCAD", "rhyme_vowel": "ABCAD"}, {"section_id": "section_1", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Y'a des gens qui pensent que l'\u00eatre humain il est mauvais", "rhyme": "E", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Qu'il est m\u00e9chant qu'il changera jamais bref qu'il est mauvais", "rhyme": "E", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Si les gens pensent \u00e7a on va droit vers la guerre", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Si on va droit vers la guerre y'a plus qu'\u00e0 faire ses pri\u00e8res", "rhyme": "ER", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Alors pense pas \u00e7a, pense pas que l'homme est mauvais !", "rhyme": "E", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Il est bon comme moi \u00e0 part quand j'\u00e9tais enfant", "rhyme": "#", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "D\u00e9capitais les mouches torturer les fourmis", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Oui je me vengeais sur ce qui \u00e9tait plus petit", "rhyme": "i", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AABBACDD", "rhyme_vowel": "AAAAABCC"}, {"section_id": "section_2", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "King Ju", "rhyme": "y", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Le fl\u00e9au", "rhyme": "o", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Ras-Ras-Rascar Capac", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "King Ju", "rhyme": "y", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Le fl\u00e9au", "rhyme": "o", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Ras-Ras-Rascar Capac", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABCABC", "rhyme_vowel": "ABCABC"}, {"section_id": "section_3", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Ce que je t'\u00e9cris je le crie et c'est le secret de ma secte", "rhyme": "Ekt", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Mes textes claquent, t'agacent comme un insecte", "rhyme": "Ekt", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Mon son cradingue, crack, p\u00e8te comme une cracotte", "rhyme": "Ot", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Tout le monde se frotte alors \u00e0 quat' pattes, cocotte", "rhyme": "Ot", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Ouais j'trippe sur les trucks trash", "rhyme": "aS", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "J'suis pas s\u00fbr de sucrer", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Sous [crom' ?] cram\u00e9, j'ai l'sacr\u00e9 \u00e0 massacrer", "rhyme": "e", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "Stup et Flip c'est pas fait pour les cr\u00e9tins", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "A bas la hi\u00e9rarchie jusqu'\u00e0 la saint glinglin", "rhyme": ")", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "AABBCDDEE", "rhyme_vowel": "AABBCDDEE"}, {"section_id": "section_4", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "King Ju", "rhyme": "y", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Le fl\u00e9au", "rhyme": "o", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Ras-Ras-Rascar Capac", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "King Ju", "rhyme": "y", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Le fl\u00e9au", "rhyme": "o", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Ras-Ras-Rascar Capac", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABCABC", "rhyme_vowel": "ABCABC"}, {"section_id": "section_5", "type": "couplet", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Oui le Crou est cracra, cram\u00e9 et grotesque", "rhyme": "Esk", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Le Crou est cra", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Tout ce qui craint enfin presque", "rhyme": "Esk", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "3", "text": "Le Crou cravache dans la boue", "rhyme": "u", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "4", "text": "Casse la cruche", "rhyme": "yS", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "5", "text": "Le Crou en cravate agressif comme une perruche", "rhyme": "yS", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "6", "text": "Quant \u00e0 toi mon gars je sais tout ce que tu fais ?", "rhyme": "E", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "7", "text": "T'es assis, debout, couch\u00e9, en train d'\u00e9couter un cd", "rhyme": "aR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "8", "text": "Tu \u00e9coutes du son \u00e0 travers du mat\u00e9riel", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "9", "text": "Scotch\u00e9 comme une grosse mouche \u00e0 miel", "rhyme": "El", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABACDDEFGG", "rhyme_vowel": "ABACDDABAA"}, {"section_id": "section_6", "type": "refrain", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "King Ju", "rhyme": "y", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Le fl\u00e9au", "rhyme": "o", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Ras-Ras-Rascar Capac", "rhyme": "a", "persona_id": "kingju"}], "rhyme": "ABC", "rhyme_vowel": "ABC"}, {"section_id": "section_7", "type": "outro", "performer": "", "lines": [{"n": "0", "text": "Alors les petits canards \u00e7a va les p'tis canards", "rhyme": "aR", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "1", "text": "Le Crou Stup\u00e9flip est l\u00e0, entre autres, pour terroriser la population", "rhyme": "$", "persona_id": "kingju"}, {"n": "2", "text": "Et par l\u00e0-m\u00eame instaurer une nouvelle \u0